			"description": "Mushy and Shroom spawn mycelium with 3 inactive Spore Mushrooms with a portion of their health missing. These mushrooms can take damage and receive healing. Their max health is 25% of the hero's health. Once the mushroom's health is fully replenished, it runs towards the enemy and explodes. The explosion deals damage and shrouds enemies within a short range in a Mushroom Spore cloud, silencing them for 4s. Nearby enemies not affected by Mushroom Spores yet are prioritized when selecting a target. Cooldown: 11s"
